  <AltText>
    Satoki's furry reference sheet. She is a fennec fox with red fur with cream underbelly, paws, and tail tip. They also have large fennec ears, and two small horns hidden behind them. Fox has heterochromia, with the right eye being pink and the left eye being red. She also has her claws out. There are scars on their arms. Fox is wearing a red collar with a heart motif, and an orange dress with a pink flower pattern. Above her is her name, written in Japanese as 虹川郷鬼 and in English as 'Satoki Nijikawa'. To their immediate right is their height, which is 128.3 cm. Further left from the height is a female symbol indicating that Satoki is not masculine whatsoever, and fox's pronouns, which are, at the time, she/her. The pronouns are she/they/fox now. Below the pronouns are the colours used for: fur, ears, tail, horns, claws, eyes, clothes, and scars.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    Satoki's furry reference sheet.
  </Description>
